# chorus:security — REMOVED #3735 (Wren blessed 2026-08-02). It was a competing,
# stale V1 definition (atStep Proving, ownedBy chorus:silas not role-silas,
# definesVocabulary carrying the dead TrustMetric and missing APISurface/Gate).
# security is Silas's by the convergence boundary; its SOLE definition now lives
# in roles/silas/ontology/security-model-3618.ttl (atStep Operating, the current
# 6-class vocabulary). Two MODEL_SET files defining one subject let the deploy
# pick the stale one — the root cause of APISurface reading unclaimed live.

